  "description": "List all followers on a Zendesk ticket. Use when you need to see who is following a ticket, such as when coordinating with stakeholders or managing ticket notifications. Followers receive notifications about the ticket. Each follower is a user object with basic profile information. Paginate through results using page and per_page parameters.",
